Description:Your Youthful Knight (2/1 first strike) and Grizzly Bears (2/2) are attacking. The opponent is at 7 life and controls no creatures. You control two untapped Swamps and have Mukotai Ambusher (3/2 lifelink, ninjutsu {1}{B}) in hand. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-ninjutsu-first-strike | Ninjutsu can be activated whenever you have an unblocked attacker, including in the first-strike combat damage step (CR 702.49a); a creature put onto the battlefield attacking after that step deals its damage in the regular step (CR 510.4, 508.4d): return the Knight after it has dealt its 2 for 2+2+3
